    short: "Scripture says Christ was foreknown and we were chosen in him “before the foundation of the world”. Whether God would have become human even without sin is an old and honest debate: Scotus and the Franciscans said yes; Aquinas thought it more fitting to say the Incarnation was ordained as a remedy for sin.",
